<item><title>UN mission leaves Western Sahara without renewed mandate</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-leaves-western-sahara-without-renewed-mandate-3a2950/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-leaves-western-sahara-without-renewed-mandate-3a2950/</guid><category>Western Sahara</category><description>Polisario Front leader Brahim Ghali ordered a general mobilisation on 10 November after an emergency meeting, as ECS Saharaui reported Moroccan troops moving along the wall once.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:28:40 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" length="38182" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Polisario rejects MINURSO after UN Security Council declines renewal</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/polisario-rejects-minurso-after-un-security-council-e1a7c0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/polisario-rejects-minurso-after-un-security-council-e1a7c0/</guid><category>Western Sahara</category><description>At a Madrid conference, its Europe delegate said the mission had failed to deliver the referendum it was created to organise in 1991.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:22:34 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" length="38182" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Saharawi television prepares documentary on people and resource extraction</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/saharawi-television-prepares-documentary-on-people-and-f243fb/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/saharawi-television-prepares-documentary-on-people-and-f243fb/</guid><category>Western Sahara</category><description>“Nazif Samit” examines Saharawis living under Moroccan occupation and the resources taken from the territory, according to its authors.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:06:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" length="38182" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eh.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>UN mission to leave Western Sahara by 31 January 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-to-leave-western-sahara-by-31-january-2027-e0ee80/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-to-leave-western-sahara-by-31-january-2027-e0ee80/</guid><category>Western Sahara</category><description>The 35-year-old Minurso ends without a vote on the region’s political future, but helped secure a ceasefire between Morocco and the Polisario Front.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:01:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-to-leave-western-sahara-by-31-january-2027-e0ee80/share.jpg" length="41651" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eh/un-mission-to-leave-western-sahara-by-31-january-2027-e0ee80/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
